# The builder stage installs and compiles everything itself; host-built
# node_modules or dist copied in by `COPY packages/ packages/` would replace
# them with artifacts for the wrong platform. Keep secrets out of the context.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/coverage
**/*.log
.git
